  "lines": [
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Come in, both of you. How are the knees?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "The right one's the bad one, it's swollen most evenings."},
    {"role": "partner", "text": "He's been coming in with a limp from the garden most days, though I'm not always there to see it."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "And the tablets, what's he taking at the moment?"},
    {"role": "partner", "text": "The paracetamol, and the gel."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Let me have a look. Can you straighten it right out?"},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "It doesn't quite go straight, there's warmth over the right knee, and it creaks when it bends."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "I'd like to add something. You're going to take naproxen 500 milligrams twice a day with food, for two weeks, and come off it sooner if your stomach complains."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "On a good day, cycle on the exercise bike for ten minutes with no resistance."},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "I can manage that."},
    {"role": "partner", "text": "I'll make sure he does."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Lovely, I'll see you both in a month."}
  ],
